  "content": "\n\n<h1>DarkSmithing</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>用于下界合金升级和盔甲纹饰的锻造模板自定义合成配方</p>\n<p><em>支持服务端。你可以仅在服务端安装此模组，无需在客户端安装。</em></p>\n<p>由制作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一作者团队开发（如需完整 RPG 体验，请获取 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，享受任务与角色扮演玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h5>（得益于这些功能，你的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升）</h5>\n<h5>不想费力寻找锻造模板？或者急着给某件盔甲添加纹饰？只需轻松合成即可。使用自定义配方制作各种锻造模板，然后复制它们以进行后续锻造。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（现已包含 1.21 版本新增的“闪电”与“流水”盔甲纹饰模板）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含的配方：-</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界合金升级</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哨兵盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">恼鬼盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">野性盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海岸盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙丘盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寻路者盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">唤潮者盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">塑形者盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宿主盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">守御盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寂灭盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">潮汐盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猪鼻盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">肋骨盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">眼目盔甲纹饰</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建议使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp; 查看配方。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">想要更多自定义配方？试试 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkBindings</a>，提供 100 多种自定义生活便利类配方。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">示例：-</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/897/123/darksmithing-screenshot.png\" width=\"830\" height=\"1600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即购买服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅 &amp; 使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 立减 25！</span></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
